# Design System Imports

All UI components, tokens, and patterns MUST be imported from `@charts-gen/ui`. Direct imports from `packages/design-system/` or relative paths into other UI packages are forbidden.

## Why
Maintains a single stable entry point for all UI and allows for structural changes in the design system without affecting application code.

## Examples
// ❌ BAD
import { Button } from '../../packages/design-system/components/Button';
import { tokens } from '@/shared/tokens';

// ✅ GOOD
import { Button, tokens } from '@charts-gen/ui';
